/* This is the custom text definition file for TASMx. For each character
/* at the start of the line (single characters only - ASCII only) the 
/* value will be written. The value may be in normal numeric representation
/* just like the rest of TASMx.
/*
/*CHAR 	VALUE */
/*-------------------------------------------*/
